# The Blender plugin's environment: Python alone - its worker (worker.py)
# needs no package; Blender itself, its official build, is fetched by Meno
# beside it as the plugin is set up (the manifest's `downloads`), and
# render.py runs in Blender's own Python.
# Locked, with hashes, by:
#   uv pip compile --universal --python-version 3.12 --generate-hashes requirements.in -o requirements.lock
